    "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 421.952993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国秋天最有诗意的湖泊是哪一个吗？有人说是杭州西湖两千多年文人题咏平湖秋月，伴着满城桂香。有人说是新疆喀纳斯阿尔泰山密林深处，两千多米长卷泼翻了整座金秋，对不住了，西湖，连前四都进不了，喀纳斯也不是第一。真正排在第一名的那一处，从不跟名山大川争锋，只静静隐在万山褶皱深处。它的湖水清的能望穿十二米深处的水草。深秋里，万亩草海金黄，如梦，一叶，独木舟荡开成雾，接得住人间所有的湖泊。今天，咱们就来盘点中国秋天十大最有诗意的湖泊。话不多说，茶给您沏好了，劳烦您顺手点个小红心，咱们这就开讲。第十名瘦西湖，江苏扬州瘦西湖，您肯定听过二十四桥明月夜，杜牧写的风雅全在这儿。两百多亩狭长水面如同一条青色丝绢，穿行于亭台楼阁，与画房曲桥之间。当年，扬州盐商耗银千万，依水叠石造园，把江南世人的青雅做到了极致。秋风一吹，两岸垂柳泛起微黄，白塔古桥倒映在建寿的水波里不见了。三月的喧闹，只剩下沉静的书卷气。您在湖畔走上一圈，心绪，便跟着水波慢了下来。这不是热烈的秋。这是江南文人留给岁月的一抹清倦，您说这算不算最舒心的雅致？第九名，长白山天池、吉林东南部诗意不一定在江南。他在长白山主峰的火山口里，水面海拔两千一百多米，最深处，三百七十多米一圈，十六座山峰把湖水围在当中。一千多年前，那场大喷发过后，火山口里的水慢慢存下来，才有了这面天上的镜子。深秋时节，十六封先落了一层薄雪白的山，蓝的水，蓝得像一块嵌在天边的玄律四下，没有一点声音。这一年里有大半年封着冰雪，哪天能看清全貌，全凭运气上去的人都得赶个好天，赶不上，也只能笑笑下山。边塞失里的冷峻，高拔孤傲，原来长在这里，您说这是不是另一种诗意？第八名？云南大理洱海，他在点苍山脚下，弧形像一只耳朵，面积两百五十多平方公里，苍山十九封，十八条溪水，一路流下来，全汇进。这片湖里秋高气爽，苍山顶上先披一层薄雪，岸边的红山红了，倒映在水里一阵风过去，水鸟擦着水皮飞。您要是在岸边找个地方坐下，能做一整个下午不用做什么，也也没人催您。岸边的白族人，家门口晒的红红的辣椒和玉米，老人搬个小凳就坐在水边一坐就是半天大半辈子都在照顾别人，到了这儿才算被允许慢下来，给操劳半生的自己松一松绑，这就是洱海的诗意。第七名，纳木错，西藏拉萨与那曲之间海拔四千七百多米的高原圣湖，接近两千平方公里的广袤水域，是直抵灵魂的苍茫。深秋，游人少了湖水，还没封冻，懒得让人说不出话。风一吹，岸边的鲸幡哗啦啦响转，胡的藏族老人一步一步走，嘴里念着经脚下不停。多少人到了这儿，原本想说点什么，结果站了半天，一个字没说。撞壶的人一圈要走好些天，走得慢，可没人嫌卖，也没人急着赶路，更没人回头张望。站在这样大的天地底下，您心里那些放不下的事忽然就小了，他不说话，却让人放下。您说这算不算最纯粹的释怀？第六名，洞庭湖，湖南岳阳。两千多平方公里，浩瀚水域吞吐长江，自古便有八百里洞庭的壮阔。声明，范仲淹写沙鸥降集锦。林游泳，杜甫写吴楚东南主乾坤日夜浮，千百年文脉，全凝在这片水里。深秋的洞庭寒波万叠如花，像雪一样飘在水面，沙鸥落下去又飞起来。登上岳阳楼，往湖上一望天水连成一片，望不到边。一个老人的泪，一个贤臣的胸襟都沉在这片水里。您说，这是何等博大的胸襟与尸骨。从第十道第六名，瘦西湖藏着江南文人的清雅天池，展现云端孤傲的玄律洱还给疲惫身心解了绑纳木错，用纯净的定胜兰荡敌反扰洞庭湖，用吞吐乾坤的大胸襟震撼古今，可他们还不是最有诗意的。接下来第五道第一名更厉害，有一座湖名满天下，秋风一吹，落满贵子残何听雨。有一座湖深秋水退千顷，湖底，竟然生生化作粉紫花海与千年石岛，可排在榜首的那座深山明镜。一平如镜的水面上只飘着白花与独木舟静的能听见自己的心跳。他是哪个湖？他凭什么排在西湖前面？下一集已经同步更新，点开我的头像，进入主页就能看到点个关注，看看谁才是中国秋天最有诗意的湖泊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 3930,
      "text": "您知道中国秋天最有诗意的湖泊是哪一个吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4210,
      "end_ms": 10930,
      "text": "有人说是杭州西湖两千多年文人题咏平湖秋月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00003",
      "start_ms": 10990,
      "end_ms": 12610,
      "text": "伴着满城桂香。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00004",
      "start_ms": 13030,
      "end_ms": 17510,
      "text": "有人说是新疆喀纳斯阿尔泰山密林深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00005",
      "start_ms": 17970,
      "end_ms": 21410,
      "text": "两千多米长卷泼翻了整座金秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00006",
      "start_ms": 21890,
      "end_ms": 22670,
      "text": "对不住了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00007",
      "start_ms": 23150,
      "end_ms": 23690,
      "text": "西湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23850,
      "end_ms": 25410,
      "text": "连前四都进不了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00009",
      "start_ms": 25850,
      "end_ms": 27330,
      "text": "喀纳斯也不是第一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00010",
      "start_ms": 27790,
      "end_ms": 29845,
      "text": "真正排在第一名的那一处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00011",
      "start_ms": 30260,
      "end_ms": 32380,
      "text": "从不跟名山大川争锋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00012",
      "start_ms": 33080,
      "end_ms": 36580,
      "text": "只静静隐在万山褶皱深处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00013",
      "start_ms": 36980,
      "end_ms": 40520,
      "text": "它的湖水清的能望穿十二米深处的水草。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41100,
      "end_ms": 41860,
      "text": "深秋里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00015",
      "start_ms": 41860,
      "end_ms": 43220,
      "text": "万亩草海金黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43300,
      "end_ms": 43700,
      "text": "如梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00017",
      "start_ms": 44060,
      "end_ms": 44540,
      "text": "一叶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00018",
      "start_ms": 44560,
      "end_ms": 46319,
      "text": "独木舟荡开成雾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00019",
      "start_ms": 46700,
      "end_ms": 48840,
      "text": "接得住人间所有的湖泊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00020",
      "start_ms": 49300,
      "end_ms": 49740,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00021",
      "start_ms": 49760,
      "end_ms": 54220,
      "text": "咱们就来盘点中国秋天十大最有诗意的湖泊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00022",
      "start_ms": 54600,
      "end_ms": 55420,
      "text": "话不多说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00023",
      "start_ms": 55920,
      "end_ms": 57160,
      "text": "茶给您沏好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00024",
      "start_ms": 57740,
      "end_ms": 59645,
      "text": "劳烦您顺手点个小红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00025",
      "start_ms": 60020,
      "end_ms": 61045,
      "text": "咱们这就开讲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00026",
      "start_ms": 61360,
      "end_ms": 63375,
      "text": "第十名瘦西湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00027",
      "start_ms": 63750,
      "end_ms": 65940,
      "text": "江苏扬州瘦西湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00028",
      "start_ms": 65960,
      "end_ms": 69065,
      "text": "您肯定听过二十四桥明月夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00029",
      "start_ms": 69440,
      "end_ms": 71425,
      "text": "杜牧写的风雅全在这儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00030",
      "start_ms": 71800,
      "end_ms": 76325,
      "text": "两百多亩狭长水面如同一条青色丝绢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00031",
      "start_ms": 77000,
      "end_ms": 78800,
      "text": "穿行于亭台楼阁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00032",
      "start_ms": 79060,
      "end_ms": 80885,
      "text": "与画房曲桥之间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00033",
      "start_ms": 81620,
      "end_ms": 82060,
      "text": "当年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82100,
      "end_ms": 84365,
      "text": "扬州盐商耗银千万，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00035",
      "start_ms": 84770,
      "end_ms": 86375,
      "text": "依水叠石造园，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00036",
      "start_ms": 86940,
      "end_ms": 89825,
      "text": "把江南世人的青雅做到了极致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00037",
      "start_ms": 90260,
      "end_ms": 91320,
      "text": "秋风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00038",
      "start_ms": 91760,
      "end_ms": 94125,
      "text": "两岸垂柳泛起微黄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94720,
      "end_ms": 99130,
      "text": "白塔古桥倒映在建寿的水波里不见了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00040",
      "start_ms": 99130,
      "end_ms": 100305,
      "text": "三月的喧闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00041",
      "start_ms": 100780,
      "end_ms": 102965,
      "text": "只剩下沉静的书卷气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00042",
      "start_ms": 103630,
      "end_ms": 105775,
      "text": "您在湖畔走上一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00043",
      "start_ms": 106340,
      "end_ms": 106860,
      "text": "心绪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00044",
      "start_ms": 107080,
      "end_ms": 109255,
      "text": "便跟着水波慢了下来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00045",
      "start_ms": 109630,
      "end_ms": 111145,
      "text": "这不是热烈的秋。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00046",
      "start_ms": 111760,
      "end_ms": 115755,
      "text": "这是江南文人留给岁月的一抹清倦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00047",
      "start_ms": 116270,
      "end_ms": 118795,
      "text": "您说这算不算最舒心的雅致？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00048",
      "start_ms": 119130,
      "end_ms": 119975,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00049",
      "start_ms": 120710,
      "end_ms": 126435,
      "text": "长白山天池、吉林东南部诗意不一定在江南。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00050",
      "start_ms": 127130,
      "end_ms": 130335,
      "text": "他在长白山主峰的火山口里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00051",
      "start_ms": 130730,
      "end_ms": 132985,
      "text": "水面海拔两千一百多米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00052",
      "start_ms": 133340,
      "end_ms": 134080,
      "text": "最深处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00053",
      "start_ms": 134120,
      "end_ms": 136150,
      "text": "三百七十多米一圈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00054",
      "start_ms": 136210,
      "end_ms": 139205,
      "text": "十六座山峰把湖水围在当中。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00055",
      "start_ms": 139610,
      "end_ms": 140670,
      "text": "一千多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00056",
      "start_ms": 140670,
      "end_ms": 142135,
      "text": "那场大喷发过后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00057",
      "start_ms": 142510,
      "end_ms": 144950,
      "text": "火山口里的水慢慢存下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00058",
      "start_ms": 145270,
      "end_ms": 147215,
      "text": "才有了这面天上的镜子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00059",
      "start_ms": 147680,
      "end_ms": 148835,
      "text": "深秋时节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00060",
      "start_ms": 149370,
      "end_ms": 153055,
      "text": "十六封先落了一层薄雪白的山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00061",
      "start_ms": 153440,
      "end_ms": 154065,
      "text": "蓝的水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00062",
      "start_ms": 154530,
      "end_ms": 158990,
      "text": "蓝得像一块嵌在天边的玄律四下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00063",
      "start_ms": 159050,
      "end_ms": 160245,
      "text": "没有一点声音。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00064",
      "start_ms": 160640,
      "end_ms": 163225,
      "text": "这一年里有大半年封着冰雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00065",
      "start_ms": 163700,
      "end_ms": 165315,
      "text": "哪天能看清全貌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00066",
      "start_ms": 165670,
      "end_ms": 169465,
      "text": "全凭运气上去的人都得赶个好天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00067",
      "start_ms": 170240,
      "end_ms": 170900,
      "text": "赶不上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00068",
      "start_ms": 171220,
      "end_ms": 172995,
      "text": "也只能笑笑下山。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00069",
      "start_ms": 173400,
      "end_ms": 175155,
      "text": "边塞失里的冷峻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00070",
      "start_ms": 175570,
      "end_ms": 177025,
      "text": "高拔孤傲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00071",
      "start_ms": 177350,
      "end_ms": 178615,
      "text": "原来长在这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00072",
      "start_ms": 179150,
      "end_ms": 181765,
      "text": "您说这是不是另一种诗意？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00073",
      "start_ms": 182170,
      "end_ms": 182875,
      "text": "第八名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00074",
      "start_ms": 183480,
      "end_ms": 184835,
      "text": "云南大理洱海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00075",
      "start_ms": 185470,
      "end_ms": 187235,
      "text": "他在点苍山脚下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00076",
      "start_ms": 187750,
      "end_ms": 189415,
      "text": "弧形像一只耳朵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00077",
      "start_ms": 189820,
      "end_ms": 192085,
      "text": "面积两百五十多平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00078",
      "start_ms": 192600,
      "end_ms": 193845,
      "text": "苍山十九封，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00079",
      "start_ms": 194300,
      "end_ms": 195445,
      "text": "十八条溪水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00080",
      "start_ms": 195870,
      "end_ms": 196890,
      "text": "一路流下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00081",
      "start_ms": 196890,
      "end_ms": 197690,
      "text": "全汇进。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00082",
      "start_ms": 197690,
      "end_ms": 200175,
      "text": "这片湖里秋高气爽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00083",
      "start_ms": 200710,
      "end_ms": 203415,
      "text": "苍山顶上先披一层薄雪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00084",
      "start_ms": 203990,
      "end_ms": 205775,
      "text": "岸边的红山红了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00085",
      "start_ms": 206170,
      "end_ms": 208950,
      "text": "倒映在水里一阵风过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00086",
      "start_ms": 209290,
      "end_ms": 211275,
      "text": "水鸟擦着水皮飞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00087",
      "start_ms": 211730,
      "end_ms": 214175,
      "text": "您要是在岸边找个地方坐下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00088",
      "start_ms": 214530,
      "end_ms": 217395,
      "text": "能做一整个下午不用做什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00089",
      "start_ms": 217840,
      "end_ms": 219535,
      "text": "也也没人催您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00090",
      "start_ms": 219940,
      "end_ms": 221320,
      "text": "岸边的白族人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00091",
      "start_ms": 221320,
      "end_ms": 224575,
      "text": "家门口晒的红红的辣椒和玉米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00092",
      "start_ms": 225060,
      "end_ms": 232255,
      "text": "老人搬个小凳就坐在水边一坐就是半天大半辈子都在照顾别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00093",
      "start_ms": 232770,
      "end_ms": 235765,
      "text": "到了这儿才算被允许慢下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00094",
      "start_ms": 236130,
      "end_ms": 238805,
      "text": "给操劳半生的自己松一松绑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00095",
      "start_ms": 239590,
      "end_ms": 241145,
      "text": "这就是洱海的诗意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00096",
      "start_ms": 241510,
      "end_ms": 242535,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00097",
      "start_ms": 242980,
      "end_ms": 243705,
      "text": "纳木错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00098",
      "start_ms": 244480,
      "end_ms": 250355,
      "text": "西藏拉萨与那曲之间海拔四千七百多米的高原圣湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00099",
      "start_ms": 250980,
      "end_ms": 254005,
      "text": "接近两千平方公里的广袤水域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00100",
      "start_ms": 254550,
      "end_ms": 256805,
      "text": "是直抵灵魂的苍茫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00101",
      "start_ms": 257200,
      "end_ms": 257660,
      "text": "深秋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00102",
      "start_ms": 257740,
      "end_ms": 259610,
      "text": "游人少了湖水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00103",
      "start_ms": 259630,
      "end_ms": 260525,
      "text": "还没封冻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00104",
      "start_ms": 261060,
      "end_ms": 262735,
      "text": "懒得让人说不出话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00105",
      "start_ms": 263280,
      "end_ms": 264045,
      "text": "风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00106",
      "start_ms": 264460,
      "end_ms": 267270,
      "text": "岸边的鲸幡哗啦啦响转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00107",
      "start_ms": 267390,
      "end_ms": 269995,
      "text": "胡的藏族老人一步一步走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00108",
      "start_ms": 270310,
      "end_ms": 272665,
      "text": "嘴里念着经脚下不停。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00109",
      "start_ms": 273090,
      "end_ms": 274385,
      "text": "多少人到了这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00110",
      "start_ms": 274800,
      "end_ms": 276345,
      "text": "原本想说点什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00111",
      "start_ms": 276790,
      "end_ms": 277985,
      "text": "结果站了半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00112",
      "start_ms": 278420,
      "end_ms": 279345,
      "text": "一个字没说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00113",
      "start_ms": 279770,
      "end_ms": 282425,
      "text": "撞壶的人一圈要走好些天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00114",
      "start_ms": 282990,
      "end_ms": 283575,
      "text": "走得慢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00115",
      "start_ms": 283890,
      "end_ms": 284955,
      "text": "可没人嫌卖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00116",
      "start_ms": 285570,
      "end_ms": 287115,
      "text": "也没人急着赶路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00117",
      "start_ms": 287440,
      "end_ms": 288885,
      "text": "更没人回头张望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00118",
      "start_ms": 289630,
      "end_ms": 291410,
      "text": "站在这样大的天地底下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00119",
      "start_ms": 291710,
      "end_ms": 295475,
      "text": "您心里那些放不下的事忽然就小了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00120",
      "start_ms": 295830,
      "end_ms": 296790,
      "text": "他不说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00121",
      "start_ms": 297170,
      "end_ms": 298575,
      "text": "却让人放下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00122",
      "start_ms": 299230,
      "end_ms": 301915,
      "text": "您说这算不算最纯粹的释怀？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00123",
      "start_ms": 302270,
      "end_ms": 302965,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00124",
      "start_ms": 303350,
      "end_ms": 304145,
      "text": "洞庭湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00125",
      "start_ms": 304790,
      "end_ms": 305745,
      "text": "湖南岳阳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00126",
      "start_ms": 306590,
      "end_ms": 308190,
      "text": "两千多平方公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00127",
      "start_ms": 308610,
      "end_ms": 310650,
      "text": "浩瀚水域吞吐长江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00128",
      "start_ms": 311310,
      "end_ms": 314230,
      "text": "自古便有八百里洞庭的壮阔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00129",
      "start_ms": 314310,
      "end_ms": 314770,
      "text": "声明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00130",
      "start_ms": 315190,
      "end_ms": 318370,
      "text": "范仲淹写沙鸥降集锦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00131",
      "start_ms": 318430,
      "end_ms": 319150,
      "text": "林游泳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00132",
      "start_ms": 319830,
      "end_ms": 323930,
      "text": "杜甫写吴楚东南主乾坤日夜浮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00133",
      "start_ms": 324650,
      "end_ms": 325850,
      "text": "千百年文脉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00134",
      "start_ms": 326170,
      "end_ms": 327950,
      "text": "全凝在这片水里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00135",
      "start_ms": 328370,
      "end_ms": 332430,
      "text": "深秋的洞庭寒波万叠如花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00136",
      "start_ms": 332490,
      "end_ms": 334470,
      "text": "像雪一样飘在水面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00137",
      "start_ms": 334990,
      "end_ms": 337380,
      "text": "沙鸥落下去又飞起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00138",
      "start_ms": 337940,
      "end_ms": 339160,
      "text": "登上岳阳楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00139",
      "start_ms": 339340,
      "end_ms": 342460,
      "text": "往湖上一望天水连成一片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00140",
      "start_ms": 342880,
      "end_ms": 343840,
      "text": "望不到边。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00141",
      "start_ms": 344240,
      "end_ms": 345440,
      "text": "一个老人的泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00142",
      "start_ms": 345760,
      "end_ms": 349340,
      "text": "一个贤臣的胸襟都沉在这片水里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00143",
      "start_ms": 349720,
      "end_ms": 350180,
      "text": "您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00144",
      "start_ms": 350600,
      "end_ms": 353340,
      "text": "这是何等博大的胸襟与尸骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00145",
      "start_ms": 353700,
      "end_ms": 355020,
      "text": "从第十道第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00146",
      "start_ms": 355420,
      "end_ms": 359220,
      "text": "瘦西湖藏着江南文人的清雅天池，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00147",
      "start_ms": 359300,
      "end_ms": 365560,
      "text": "展现云端孤傲的玄律洱还给疲惫身心解了绑纳木错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00148",
      "start_ms": 365560,
      "end_ms": 369240,
      "text": "用纯净的定胜兰荡敌反扰洞庭湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00149",
      "start_ms": 369240,
      "end_ms": 372235,
      "text": "用吞吐乾坤的大胸襟震撼古今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00150",
      "start_ms": 372670,
      "end_ms": 375025,
      "text": "可他们还不是最有诗意的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00151",
      "start_ms": 375470,
      "end_ms": 377530,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一名更厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00152",
      "start_ms": 377530,
      "end_ms": 379455,
      "text": "有一座湖名满天下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00153",
      "start_ms": 379990,
      "end_ms": 381005,
      "text": "秋风一吹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00154",
      "start_ms": 381390,
      "end_ms": 383705,
      "text": "落满贵子残何听雨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00155",
      "start_ms": 384250,
      "end_ms": 387230,
      "text": "有一座湖深秋水退千顷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00156",
      "start_ms": 387370,
      "end_ms": 387855,
      "text": "湖底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00157",
      "start_ms": 388170,
      "end_ms": 392255,
      "text": "竟然生生化作粉紫花海与千年石岛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00158",
      "start_ms": 392630,
      "end_ms": 395915,
      "text": "可排在榜首的那座深山明镜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00159",
      "start_ms": 396710,
      "end_ms": 403975,
      "text": "一平如镜的水面上只飘着白花与独木舟静的能听见自己的心跳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00160",
      "start_ms": 404730,
      "end_ms": 405805,
      "text": "他是哪个湖？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00161",
      "start_ms": 406550,
      "end_ms": 408825,
      "text": "他凭什么排在西湖前面？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00162",
      "start_ms": 409230,
      "end_ms": 411235,
      "text": "下一集已经同步更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00163",
      "start_ms": 411970,
      "end_ms": 413275,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00164",
      "start_ms": 413600,
      "end_ms": 416550,
      "text": "进入主页就能看到点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_a25671a38d9e43ae_s00165",
      "start_ms": 416710,
      "end_ms": 421635,
      "text": "看看谁才是中国秋天最有诗意的湖泊。"
    }
  ],
